# Desktop runtime dependencies for the Katherine .deb (#338).
#
# This is a DELIBERATELY SEPARATE lock from the backend's authoritative
# pyproject.toml + uv.lock (#353): the .deb ships only what the desktop
# runtime imports (the companion graph + the lazy remote provider), not
# the cloud/web stack (FastAPI, uvicorn, Supabase, torch,
# sentence-transformers) that the desktop never loads (proven by
# backend/tests/test_desktop_import_isolation.py).
#
# Versions mirror the backend lock pins (uv.lock) so the packaged app
# runs the same code as the checkout; the consistency is enforced by
# packaging/test_build_deb.py and backend/tests/test_uv_workflow.py.
#
# Native/system dependencies (NOT pip): python3-gi, WebKitGTK 4.1,
# GTK 3 — provided by the .deb Depends field, matching the validated
# environment of docs/operations/desktop-shell-linux.md.

